{"about_the_game":"Ever think of yourself as having a sharp eye? Or good at explaining stuff with pictures? Time to put your skills to the test in this fast-paced party game. While one player wears the VR headset and builds something out of blocks using their hands, the other players try to guess what they\u2019re making. Is it a house? A snake? A bowtie? Who knows! This modern twist on the classic Charades formula is jam-packed with different modes, features, and of course words, so that there\u2019s always a new way to play.<br><br>Features include:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A unique block-based building system - easy to understand, even if you\u2019re new to VR.<br></li><li> Three different game modes - player vs. player, team vs. team, and co-op.<br></li><li> Over a thousand built in words and phrases, carefully chosen to work well with the building pieces given.<br></li><li> Extra features like hidden pieces, and first-person camera, that keep things interesting.<br></li><li> Guides and tutorials so that even people with no VR experience can play and have fun.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1031830?t=1565719317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1031830?t=1565719317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1565719317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1031830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1565719317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"d